# =============================================================================
#  assets/textures/creature_grass.pix — 47-piece long-grass blob
# =============================================================================
# The route's long grass is an AREA, not a line. Tile indices follow the stable
# canonical order from tilemap::autotile_index: masks are enumerated 0..255 and the
# first occurrence of each canonical eight-neighbour shape becomes the next tile.
# Each tile keeps the plain-grass ground opaque, then extends the darker long-grass
# patch through connected edges and corners. This prevents transparent holes while
# still making the blob boundary readable against the shared Tiny Town palette.
#
# Re-bake after editing:
#   ./build/demo --cmd asset.pixels textures/creature_grass.pix textures/creature_grass.hrt
# =============================================================================

size 16
grid 47 1

palette g 79bd4f
palette t 4f963d
palette D 397631
palette l 9bd45d

